+# Attribution
+
+English common/Linux pages by the tldr-pages team and contributors:
+https://github.com/tldr-pages/tldr/tree/eacda7020c4102729187c38c35ce28fac00365c9
+
+Page content is licensed under CC BY 4.0:
+https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/
+See LICENSE.md for the original upstream notice. This data retains its upstream
+license, separately from nl-shell's Apache-2.0 code license.
+
+Selection and repackaging: all English pages/common/ and pages/linux/ files are
+repackaged as sorted path/content JSONL with original text and placeholders intact.
+No upstream scripts are included or executed. This attribution does not decide
+the separate dataset/weights release review (#34).
